{{Quote|Services available: Dry cleaning. Wash, fold. Drop off. See attendant for pricing.|Signage at Rafa's Laundry|<ref name="Trace" />}}
'''Rafa's Laundry''' was an aboveboard business located<ref name="DB">{{Databank|rafa-s-laundry|Rafa's Laundry}}</ref> on the [[planet]]<ref name="SWGA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> [[Coruscant]] on [[Level 1313]] of the [[Coruscant Underworld|underworld]].<ref name="Trace" /> It offered dry cleaning, washing, folding and drop-off, and was open 24 [[Standard hour|hour]]s a [[Standard day|day]]. Mirror-inverted signage that stated the business location and opening hours, also mentioned something called "kaashmi clean."<ref name="Aurebesh">{{TCW|Gone with a Trace}} [[Aurebesh]] signage</ref> Owned by [[Rafa Martez]] during the [[Clone Wars]] between the [[Galactic Republic]] and [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist Alliance]],<ref name="Trace" /> who obtained the business through [[gambling]],<ref name="Deal No Deal">{{TCW|Deal No Deal}}</ref> the laundromat was utilized to keep the citizens of the Coruscant Underworld in a better state of appearance. However, the facility was also utilized as a front for Martez's illegal jobs,<ref name="DB" /> such as with the [[Twi'lek]] [[Lokann]].<ref name="Trace" />

{{Struct-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Among the [[Aurebesh]] signage at Rafa's Laundry is "[[Calrissian laundry detergent|CALRISSIAN FR]]<small>''[obscured]''</small>" – "SO FRESH SO <small>''[obscured]''</small>," seemingly a nod to [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]] (who, like [[Rafa Martez]],<ref name="Trace" /> deals in [[gambling]]<ref name="ESB">{{Film|V}}</ref>). A sticker on a washing machine says "LANDOMAT," seemingly a pun on "Lando" and "laundromat."<ref name="Trace" />

